# Artifacts of `./install.sh --project .` — copies of docs/ and agents/ that
# would drift from the source of truth in this repo. `.claude/` is tracked: it
# holds this repo's own maintenance agent and command, which are never installed.
/.llmcheats/
/AGENTS.md
/.claude/agents/*
!/.claude/agents/llmcheats.md
/.claude/commands/*
!/.claude/commands/llmcheats.md
/.claude/skills/
/.claude/llmcheats/
